package hartland

model lexicon locale cs

// The carrier word list — seeded by scripts/seed_members.py from data/reference/carrier.csv (name; the name without
// its legal form) (M0 S0.1 T5). Do not edit: edit the sources and re-seed. One term per member, its words in
// `forms`; `for:` is the member vocabulary's column until M3 S3.1 T5 re-targets each term to its member
// (README.md).

def term carrier_dop_j1_cs {
    description: "Autodoprava Mašek s.r.o. (DOP-J1)"
    for: db.hartland.carrier.name
